<title>UK: Body Shop Q1 worldwide same-store sales slip.</title>
<headline>Body Shop Q1 worldwide same-store sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British &quot;green&quot; cosmetics and perfumery retailer The Body Shop Plc said on Friday worldwide sales from comparable stores were down two percent in the first quarter.</p>
<p>In a statement to the annual meeting, the company said group turnover in the first quarter was unchanged year-on-year but should resume growth over the year as a whole.</p>
</text>
